// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 05-statements/inherent_method_call_unsupported_neg_01.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// A call to an inherent struct method through an immutable receiver is
// well-formed source the HIR/MIR/LIR lowering does not admit yet. It must be
// reported as a capability gap (ZOM4125), not as a compiler incident. The
// method name is shown, not its receiver type.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4125]: method call `get` is not supported yet
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/05-statements/inherent_method_call_unsupported_neg_01.zom:8:10
